{"kind":"html","caption":"在较短数组上二分切分位置，并由总长度推导另一个数组的切分位置，使左右两部分元素数量相等。若左侧最大值不大于右侧最小值，切分即有效；示例 2 最终得到左中值 2、右中值 3，因此中位数为 2.5。二分范围只与较短数组长度有关，时间复杂度为 O(log min(m,n))，空间复杂度为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>寻找两个正序数组的中位数</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.panel{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#252526;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-top:8px}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:600}.sub{color:#8d8d8d;margin:0;font-size:12px}.mono,.value,.formula{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.status{min-height:auto;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12px}.arrays{display:grid;gap:8px}.array-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:6px;align-items:start}.array-name{padding:0;color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.cells{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.cell{min-width:48px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;padding:4px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}.cell .value{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}.cell .meta{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}.cell.left{background:#263748;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.edge{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.edge .value,.cell.edge .meta{color:#fff}.partition{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:6px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:6px;font-size:11px}.side{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px}.side strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px;color:#3794ff}.divider{display:flex;align-items:center;color:#3794ff;font-weight:600;font-size:10px}.checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.check{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:10px}.check.ok{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.formula{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:4px;color:#3794ff;font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px;background:#263748;border:1px solid #3794ff}.dot.edge{background:#0e639c}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>二分寻找正确切分</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">示例 2：<span class=\"mono\">nums1 = [1,2]</span>，<span class=\"mono\">nums2 = [3,4]</span></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2 id=\"stepTitle\">准备二分</h2>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"arrays\" id=\"arrays\"></div>\n<div class=\"partition\">\n<div class=\"side\"><strong>左半部分</strong><div id=\"leftSet\" class=\"mono\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"divider\">｜切分线｜</div>\n<div class=\"side\"><strong>右半部分</strong><div id=\"rightSet\" class=\"mono\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"checks\">\n<div id=\"checkA\" class=\"check mono\"></div>\n<div id=\"checkB\" class=\"check mono\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"formula\" class=\"formula\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>切分线左侧</span><span><i class=\"dot edge\"></i>参与边界比较</span></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst A=[1,2],B=[3,4];\nconst states=[\n {title:'第 1 步：取较短数组并确定二分范围',i:1,j:1,msg:'总元素数为 4，左半部分应包含 2 个元素。先令 nums1 的切分位置 i = 1，再计算 j = 2 - i = 1。',formula:'i = ⌊(0 + 2) / 2⌋ = 1　　j = 2 - i = 1'},\n {title:'第 2 步：检查交叉边界',i:1,j:1,msg:'nums2 左边界 3 大于 nums1 右边界 2，说明 nums1 切得太靠左；把二分下界移动到 i + 1。',formula:'B[j−1] = 3 > A[i] = 2　⇒　向右移动 i'},\n {title:'第 3 步：得到有效切分',i:2,j:0,msg:'新的切分为 i = 2、j = 0。两个交叉条件都成立，所有左侧元素都不大于所有右侧元素。',formula:'maxLeft = max(2, −∞) = 2　　minRight = min(+∞, 3) = 3'},\n {title:'第 4 步：计算偶数长度的中位数',i:2,j:0,msg:'总长度为偶数，中位数是左侧最大值与右侧最小值的平均数。',formula:'median = (2 + 3) / 2 = 2.5'}\n];\nlet cursor=0;\nfunction val(x){return x===Infinity?'+∞':x===-Infinity?'−∞':String(x)}\nfunction bounds(arr,k){return [k===0?-Infinity:arr[k-1],k===arr.length?Infinity:arr[k]]}\nfunction row(name,arr,k){return '<div class=\"array-row\"><div class=\"array-name\">'+name+'<br><span class=\"mono\">切分位置 '+k+'</span></div><div class=\"cells\">'+arr.map((x,n)=>{const edge=n===k-1||n===k;const cls=(n<k?' left':'')+(edge?' edge':'');const role=n<k?'左侧':'右侧';return '<div class=\"cell'+cls+'\"><div class=\"value\">'+x+'</div><div class=\"meta\">下标 '+n+' · '+role+'</div></div>'}).join('')+'</div></div>'}\nfunction render(){const s=states[cursor],ab=bounds(A,s.i),bb=bounds(B,s.j);document.getElementById('stepTitle').textContent=s.title;document.getElementById('status').textContent=s.msg;document.getElementById('arrays').innerHTML=row('nums1',A,s.i)+row('nums2',B,s.j);document.getElementById('leftSet').textContent='nums1: '+JSON.stringify(A.slice(0,s.i))+'　nums2: '+JSON.stringify(B.slice(0,s.j));document.getElementById('rightSet').textContent='nums1: '+JSON.stringify(A.slice(s.i))+'　nums2: '+JSON.stringify(B.slice(s.j));const ca=document.getElementById('checkA'),cb=document.getElementById('checkB');const oka=ab[0]<=bb[1],okb=bb[0]<=ab[1];ca.textContent='A左 '+val(ab[0])+' ≤ B右 '+val(bb[1])+'：'+(oka?'成立':'不成立');cb.textContent='B左 '+val(bb[0])+' ≤ A右 '+val(ab[1])+'：'+(okb?'成立':'不成立');ca.className='check mono'+(oka?' ok':'');cb.className='check mono'+(okb?' ok':'');document.getElementById('formula').textContent=s.formula;cursor=(cursor+1)%states.length}\nrender();setInterval(render,2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
